# Ambiente — Auth / Persistência

## Postgres (Coolify: Postgres-nexus)

Criado no projeto Backend-Database / production.
Público em `72.60.61.39:<public_port>`.

```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://nexus:<password>@72.60.61.39:5412/nexus
```

Alternativa local: `docker compose up -d` → `postgresql://nexus:nexus@localhost:5432/nexus`

```bash
bun run db:push
```

## Variáveis (plugin-host) — ver `.env` / `apps/plugin-host/.env`

```
DATABASE_URL=...
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<min-32-chars-random-secret>
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:4700
NEXUS_TRUSTED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000
PORT=4700
```

Produção (subdomínios distintos `nex.` + `core.`):

```
BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://core.seudominio.com
BETTER_AUTH_COOKIE_DOMAIN=seudominio.com
NEXUS_TRUSTED_ORIGINS=https://nex.seudominio.com,https://core.seudominio.com
```

## Variáveis (web) — `apps/web/.env.local`

```
NEXUS_PLUGIN_HOST_URL=http://localhost:4700
NEXT_PUBLIC_NEXUS_CORE_URL=http://localhost:4700
```

Produção:

```
NEXUS_PLUGIN_HOST_URL=https://core.seudominio.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_NEXUS_CORE_URL=https://core.seudominio.com
```

## Bootstrap

1. Postgres acessível + `bun run db:push`
2. `bun run dev`
3. `/setup` → Owner
4. `/login`
5. Agent → Pending Agents → Approve
